inst1 660-667 A
inst1 668-899 NONE
inst1 900-907 A
inst1 908-1259 NONE
inst1 1260-1267 A
inst1 1268-1599 NONE
inst1 1600-1607 NONE 128,165
inst1 1608-1719 NONE
inst1 1720-1727 NONE 128,165
inst1 1728-1919 NONE
inst1 1920-2340 LEFT+Y
inst1 2341-2600 NONE
